{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Test Double/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"91dfef92-91ad-5051-b9a2-1bbae3b58cd1","excerpt":"📌 Test Double이란? ✅ 테스트 코드에서 실제 객체를 대체하는 가짜 객체 ✅ 독립적인 테스트를 수행할 수 있게 함   필요성 🔹 독립성 보장 실제 객체가 외부 DB, 네트워크, 파일 시스템 등 외부 시스템에 의존성을 가지면 테스트가 영향을 받을 수 있다. Test Double을 사용하면 외부 요소와 분리해 단위 테스트를 수행할 수 있다.   🔹 …","html":"<h2 id=\"-Test-Double이란\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Test-Double%EC%9D%B4%EB%9E%80\" aria-label=\" Test Double이란 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>📌 <strong>Test Double이란?</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ 테스트 코드에서 실제 객체를 대체하는 가짜 객체</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 독립적인 테스트를 수행할 수 있게 함</strong>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"필요성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"필요성 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>필요성</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 독립성 보장</strong><br>\n실제 객체가 외부 DB, 네트워크, 파일 시스템 등 외부 시스템에 의존성을 가지면 테스트가 영향을 받을 수 있다.<br>\nTest Double을 사용하면 외부 요소와 분리해 단위 테스트를 수행할 수 있다.  </p>\n<p><strong>🔹 속도 향상</strong><br>\n외부 시스템 호출이 필요한 테스트는 실행 속도가 느리다.<br>\nTest Double을 사용하면 빠르게 실행할 수 있는 가짜 객체를 활용해 빠르게 테스트를 수행할 수 있다.</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 특정 상황 쉽게 재현</strong><br>\n네트워크 오류, 응답 지연 등의 상황을 쉽게 재현하여 시뮬레이션할 수 있다.  </p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Test-Double의-종류\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Test-Double%EC%9D%98-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\" Test Double의 종류 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Test Double의 종류</strong></h2>\n<p>Test Double은 크게 다섯 가지 유형으로 분류된다.<br>\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/38915/test-double.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 21.764705882352942%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='test double' title='' src='/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/ca1dc/test-double.png' srcset='/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/e7570/test-double.png 170w,\n/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/f46e7/test-double.png 340w,\n/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/ca1dc/test-double.png 680w,\n/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/02d09/test-double.png 1020w,\n/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/9d567/test-double.png 1360w,\n/static/f7a9a454048dfa1508bd31f65b2e709a/38915/test-double.png 2182w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3 id=\"Dummy\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Dummy\" aria-label=\"Dummy permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Dummy</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 단순히 파라미터를 채우기 위해 사용</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 필수적으로 요구되지만, 실제 사용하지 않는 객체</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>예시 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DummyUser</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> <span class=\"token function\">getUsername</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 아무 동작도 하지 않음</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 테스트 코드</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">testDummy</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">NotificationService</span> notificationService <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">NotificationService</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    notificationService<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">sendNotification</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">DummyUser</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 실제 사용 X</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"Stub\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Stub\" aria-label=\"Stub permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Stub</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 미리 정해진 값을 반환하는 객체</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 복잡한 로직 없이 테스트에 필요한 최소한의 동작만 수행</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>예시 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PaymentServiceStub</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PaymentService</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">processPayment</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">double</span> amount<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 항상 성공 반환</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 테스트 코드</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">testStub</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">PaymentServiceStub</span> paymentStub <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PaymentServiceStub</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">OrderService</span> orderService <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">OrderService</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>paymentStub<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token function\">assertTrue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>orderService<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">placeOrder</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">100.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 항상 성공</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"Fake\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Fake\" aria-label=\"Fake permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Fake</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 실제 객체와 비슷하지만, 간단한 인메모리 저장소 등을 활용해 테스트 수행</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 실제 구현에 가깝지만, 완전한 기능을 제공하지 않음</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>예시 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FakeUserRepository</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserRepository</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Map</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> database <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HashMap</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">save</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        database<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">put</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getUsername</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> <span class=\"token function\">findByUsername</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> username<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> database<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">get</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>username<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 테스트 코드</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">testFake</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">FakeUserRepository</span> fakeRepo <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FakeUserRepository</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> user <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"testUser\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    fakeRepo<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">save</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token function\">assertEquals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> fakeRepo<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findByUsername</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"testUser\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// 저장된 객체 반환</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"Spy\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Spy\" aria-label=\"Spy permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Spy</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 실제 객체를 감싸 호출 정보를 감시하는 객체</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 실제 객체의 메서드를 실행하면서 호출 여부, 횟수 등의 정보 검증 가능</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>예시 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SpyList</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">T</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ArrayList</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">T</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> addCallCount <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Override</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">T</span> element<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        addCallCount<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">super</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>element<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"token function\">getAddCallCount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> addCallCount<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 테스트 코드</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">testSpy</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">SpyList</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> spyList <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SpyList</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    spyList<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    spyList<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"world\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token function\">assertEquals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> spyList<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getAddCallCount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// add()가 몇 번 호출되었는지 검증</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>🔹 Mock과의 차이점</strong><br>\nMock은 모든 동작을 가로채지만, Spy는 실제 메서드 실행한다. 따라서 사이드 이펙트를 주의해야 한다.  </p>\n<h3 id=\"Mock\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Mock\" aria-label=\"Mock permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Mock</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 호출에 대한 기대를 명세하고, 해당 내용에 따라 동작하도록 프로그래밍 된 객체</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>예시 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@ExtendWith</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">MockitoExtension</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserServiceTest</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Mock</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserRepository</span> userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@InjectMocks</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserService</span> userService<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">shouldReturnUserWhenUserIdIsProvided</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\">// Given</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> userId <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1L</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> mockUser <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"John Doe\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"john@example.com\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">when</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">thenReturn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mockUser<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\">// When</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">User</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> userService<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getUserById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\">// Then</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">assertNotNull</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">assertEquals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"John Doe\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">verify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">shouldThrowExceptionWhenUserNotFound</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\">// Given</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> userId <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2L</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">when</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">thenThrow</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UserNotFoundException</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"User not found\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\">// When &amp; Then</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">assertThrows</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">UserNotFoundException</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-></span> userService<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getUserById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">verify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-행위-검증--상태-검증\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%ED%96%89%EC%9C%84-%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D--%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C-%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D\" aria-label=\" 행위 검증  상태 검증 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 행위 검증 &#x26; 상태 검증</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"행위-검증\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%96%89%EC%9C%84-%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D\" aria-label=\"행위 검증 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>행위 검증</strong></h3>\n<p>테스트 대상(SUT)이 <strong>예상대로 다른 객체와 상호작용하는지(특정 동작을 수행하는지)</strong> 확인  </p>\n<h3 id=\"상태-검증\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%83%81%ED%83%9C-%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D\" aria-label=\"상태 검증 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>상태 검증</strong></h3>\n<p>특정 작업 수행 후 <strong>반환값이 예상대로 나오는지</strong> 확인</p>\n<h3 id=\"비교\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B9%84%EA%B5%90\" aria-label=\"비교 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>비교</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token function\">when</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">thenReturn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mockUser<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Mock 객체인 userRepository를 Stub처럼 행동하게 한다.<br>\n하지만, \"사전 정의된 기대\"를 기반으로 한다는 점에서 Mock 객체이다. </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token function\">assertNotNull</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">assertEquals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"John Doe\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getName</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>상태 검증이지만, 그 상태가 특정 행위(UserRepository의 호출)에 의해 만들어진 것이므로, 간접적으로 행위 검증의 의미도 포함될 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token function\">verify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userRepository<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">findById</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>userId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>실제 상호 작용이 수행되었는지 확인하는 행위 검증이다.</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 Mock vs Stub</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stub은 단순히 입력값에 대해 고정된 값을 반환한다. (상태 검증)</li>\n<li>Mock은 명세대로 행동한다. 따라서 반환값 뿐만 아니라 상호 작용이 예상대로 수행되었는지 검증할 수 있게 한다. (상태 검증, 행위 검증)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/3459287/whats-the-difference-between-a-mock-stub\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/3459287/whats-the-difference-between-a-mock-stub</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Test Double","date":"March 07, 2025","update":"March 07, 2025","tags":["Test"],"series":"TDD 적용을 위한 이론 정리"},"fields":{"slug":"/Test Double/","readingTime":{"minutes":5.555}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"a128a8df-b4f8-5c72-ab99-e86fdb70e115","fields":{"slug":"/TDD 개요/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"TDD 개요"}}},{"node":{"id":"b83259a7-303f-5b73-837e-aecfe60f6d6b","fields":{"slug":"/JUnit & AssertJ/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JUnit & AssertJ"}}},{"node":{"id":"91dfef92-91ad-5051-b9a2-1bbae3b58cd1","fields":{"slug":"/Test Double/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Test Double"}}},{"node":{"id":"8782e9a3-9fbc-5a45-a537-105b8b7ee723","fields":{"slug":"/Mockito/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Mockito"}}},{"node":{"id":"a946efa9-035e-5e48-868e-227bf99c287c","fields":{"slug":"/Slice Test/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Slice Test"}}},{"node":{"id":"f7d5b0c1-7380-5c33-b2ff-f35c6411f797","fields":{"slug":"/Acceptance Test/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Acceptance Test"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/JUnit & AssertJ/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JUnit & AssertJ"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/Mockito/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Mockito"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"91dfef92-91ad-5051-b9a2-1bbae3b58cd1","series":"TDD 적용을 위한 이론 정리","previousPostId":"b83259a7-303f-5b73-837e-aecfe60f6d6b","nextPostId":"8782e9a3-9fbc-5a45-a537-105b8b7ee723"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}